<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  body { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; }
  h1, h2, h3 { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0.5em; }
  .header-info { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .form-section { margin-bottom: 25px; }
  .field-row { display: flex; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .field-row > div { flex: 1; }
  .label { font-weight: bold; display: inline-block; width: 120px; }
  .checkbox-group label { margin-right: 15px; font-weight: normal; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px; text-align: left; }
  th { background-color: #f2f2f2; }
  .signature-line { margin-top: 60px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
</style>
<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: right;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">PAGE</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 16pt; margin: 0;">UNIVERSITY</h2>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Work toward greatness.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <h2 style="text-align: center; font-size: 16pt;">OFFICE OF STUDENT ASSISTANCE (OSA)</h2>
    <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 10pt;">PERMISSION TO ENROLL IN AN UNDERGRADUATE COURSE AT ANOTHER INSTITUTION (CAAI)</p>
    <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 10pt;">PLEASE RETURN TO THE OFFICE OF STUDENT ASSISTANCE (OSA)</p>
    <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 10pt;">VIA SCAN & EMAIL TO OSA@PACE.EDU. Any questions call 1(877) 672-1830.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <div class="field-row">
      <div style="width: 30%;">
        <span class="label">STUDENT ID NUMBER</span>
        <span data-field="student_id_number">{{ student_id_number }}</span>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 20%;">
        <span class="label">LAST NAME</span>
        <span data-field="last_name">{{ last_name }}</span>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 20%;">
        <span class="label">FIRST NAME</span>
        <span data-field="first_name">{{ first_name }}</span>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 30%;">
        <span class="label">MIDDLE</span>
        <span data-field="middle_name">{{ middle_name }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="field-row">
      <div style="width: 33%;">
        <span class="label">STREET ADDRESS/P.O. BOX</span>
        <span data-field="address">{{ address }}</span>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 20%;">
        <span class="label">CITY</span>
        <span data-field="city">{{ city }}</span>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 17%;">
        <span class="label">STATE</span>
        <span data-field="state">{{ state }}</span>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 17%;">
        <span class="label">ZIP CODE</span>
        <span data-field="zip_code">{{ zip_code }}</span>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 10%;">
        <span class="label">PHONE NUMBER</span>
        <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <p>
      <span style="font-weight: bold;">*</span>HAVE YOU SUBMITTED A GRADUATION DIPLOMA VERIFICATION FORM? [ ] YES [ ] NO
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <p>I understand that in order to take a course at another institution I must fulfill the following requirements (check each box as acknowledgement of each requirement):</p>
    <div class="checkbox-group" style="margin-left: 20px;">
      <label><input type="checkbox"> I must be a matriculated undergraduate student in good academic standing (GPA 2.0 or above)</label><br>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> I must be in good financial standing at the time of application</label><br>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> I must complete at least 50% of my major and minor requirements at Pace University</label><br>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> I must complete a minimum of 25% of the total number credits required for my degree in residence.</label><br>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> I may not study at another College or University during a term in which I am enrolled at Pace University</label><br>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> I must obtain pre-approval from the College or University in which I am a major and from the department in which the equivalent Pace course is offered. Courses not pre-approved will not be accepted for transfer credit.</label><br>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> A maximum of 12 credits may be taken at other Colleges/Universities once I have matriculated at Pace (except for Study Abroad & other Pace approved programs)</label><br>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Attend only a regionally accredited college or university if I have completed 68 or more Pace and transfer credits.</label><br>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Earn a grade of "C" or better in order to have course credits transferred to Pace.</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <p>Transfer credit cannot be used for reputation of Pace Grades. All other policies relating to transfer credits, as they appear in the University catalog, remain in effect. Please attach a course description of the course you intend to take at the other institution.</p>
  </div>

  <table style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Pace Cum GPA</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Degree</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Major</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Campus</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Total Transfer Credits</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Total Pace Credits</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="pace_cum_gpa">{{ pace_cum_gpa }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="degree">{{ degree }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="major">{{ major }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="campus">{{ campus }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="total_transfer_credits">{{ total_transfer_credits }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="total_pace_credits">{{ total_pace_credits }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="form-section" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>I request permission to enroll in the course listed below at <span data-field="school">{{ school }}</span>.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="signature-line">
    <div>
      <p>Student's Signature</p>
      <p style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; margin-top: 50px;"></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>Date</p>
      <p style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; margin-top: 50px;"></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">APPROVAL OF THE STUDENT'S COLLEGE/SCHOOL AT PACE</h3>

  <table style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 20%;">Department</th>
        <th style="width: 20%;">Course #</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Course Title at Other Institution</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Credits</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">2 or 4 year school</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in course_approvals %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="course_approvals[{{ loop.index0 }}].department">{{ course_approvals[loop.index0].department }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="course_approvals[{{ loop.index0 }}].course_number">{{ course_approvals[loop.index0].course_number }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="course_approvals[{{ loop.index0 }}].course_title">{{ course_approvals[loop.index0].course_title }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="course_approvals[{{ loop.index0 }}].credits">{{ course_approvals[loop.index0].credits }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="course_approvals[{{ loop.index0 }}].is_2_or_4_year">{{ course_approvals[loop.index0].is_2_or_4_year }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="form-section" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>The course at the other College/University is equivalent to the Pace course in my dept. and may be accepted for transfer credit. See Transfer Credit Equivalency Database for pre-approved courses. <a href="https://appsvy.pace.edu/tceweb/">https://appsvy.pace.edu/tceweb/</a></p>
  </div>

  <div class="signature-line">
    <div>
      <p>Chairperson's Signature</p>
      <p style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; margin-top: 50px;"></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>Dept.</p>
      <p style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; margin-top: 50px;"></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>Date</p>
      <p style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; margin-top: 50px;"></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px;">OFFICE OF STUDENT ASSISTANCE VERIFICATION</h3>

  <p>The above name student is in good academic and financial standing and has approval to register for the course indicated above.</p>

  <div class="signature-line" style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <div>
      <p>University Registrar's Signature</p>
      <p style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; margin-top: 50px;"></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>Date</p>
      <p style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; margin-top: 50px;"></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section" style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">IMPORTANT:</p> Upon completion of the course, the student must have an <span data-field="official_transcript">{{ official_transcript }}</span> from the other College/University forwarded to Pace University Office of Student Assistance, One Pace Plaza New York, NY 10038
  </div>

  <table style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 30%;">FOR OFFICE USE ONLY:</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;"></th>
        <th style="width: 20%;"></th>
        <th style="width: 20%;"></th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Good Academic Standing [ ] YES [ ] NO</td>
        <td>Total Pace Credits</td>
        <td>Cum GPA</td>
        <td>Currently Registered [ ] YES [ ] NO</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Good Financial Standing [ ] YES [ ] NO</td>
        <td>Total Transfer Credits</td>
        <td></td>
        <td>Regionally Accredited [ ] YES [ ] NO</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="signature-line" style="margin-top: 60px;">
    <div>
      <p>Approved by OSA [ ] NO</p>
      <p style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; margin-top: 50px;"></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>OSA Advisor</p>
      <p style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; margin-top: 50px;"></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>Date</p>
      <p style="border-bottom: 1px solid black; margin-top: 50px;"></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>